OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRather
OL,6,Fcloudy with further patchy rain are
OL,7,Flikely into the evening and overnight,
OL,8,Fperhaps with some heavier bursts over
OL,9,Fthe hills of Cumbria. Winds freshening
OL,10,Fa little later in the night.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FOvercast for much of the
OL,13,Fmorning with outbreaks of rain and
OL,14,Fdrizzle, the heaviest of which will be
OL,15,Facross the north of the region. Drier
OL,16,Flater with some warm sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
