OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FThe
OL,6,Fmixed theme conditions into the rest
OL,7,Fof the week. There will be some warm
OL,8,Fsunshine at times. However, showers
OL,9,Fare also likely, especially in the
OL,10,Fnorth. Temperatures near average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
